<title>UK: World Bank adds 1.0 billion rand to 20-year bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank adds 1.0 billion rand to 20-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond increase was announced by lead manager Hambros Bank Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT   *1.0 BLN RAND  COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    04.APR.17</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  7.40	PAY DATE    12.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.50	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES     *BRINGS TOTAL SIZE TO 6.0 BLN RAND.</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/GB/ZA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.25	PRAECIPUUM  0.10</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
